sequenceDiagram
actor A as Sender
actor B as Receiver
participant API as FriendRequestController
participant S as FriendRequestService
participant DB as Repositories
participant E as ApplicationEventPublisher
participant N as NotificationService
A->>API: POST friend request
API->>S: authenticated sender and receiver
S->>DB: validate users, friendship and pending requests
S->>DB: save PENDING request
S->>E: publish FriendRequestSentEvent
E->>N: synchronous listener
N->>DB: save notification
N-->>B: WebSocket notification
B->>API: accept current request ID
API->>S: accept(receiver, requestId)
S->>DB: authorize receiver, ACCEPTED + friendship
S->>E: publish accepted event
E->>N: save/push notification
N-->>A: accepted notification
